  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "almost, nearly",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这两个词是同义词，意为“几乎，将近”，在修饰 n.、v.、adv.、adj. 时，可互换。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "在和 no、none、nothing、never 等词连用时，只能用 almost，相当于 hardly any。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "It’s "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "almost/nearly"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " midnight. 将近半夜了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "Almost"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " no one (= Hardly anyone) knew what had happened. 几乎无人知道发生了什么。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "Almost"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " none (= Hardly any) of these shirts fits him well. 这些衬衫几乎没有一件合他的身。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
